ine/godot/pull/123640.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123640.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes [#12006](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/issues/12006)\n\n#### Changes made\n\n- Documented on `SceneMultiplayer.allow_object_decoding` that only the properties configured with `PROPERTY_USAGE_STORAGE` are serialized, so every other member arrives with the value it is initialized with rather than the one the sender had.\n- Documented that the receiver instantiates the object and reattaches its script by its `res://` path, and that encoding an object whose script has no such path, or decoding one whose script cannot be loaded on the receiver, fails instead.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123640/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123640/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}